/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"},{"text":"Gross margin of 52.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $128.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (1.4% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"}],"bear":[{"text":"Debt of $2.1bn against equity of $622.5m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000182247926000031/0001822479-26-000031-index.htm","accession":"0001822479-26-000031"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1822479/000119312526242452/0001193125-26-242452-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url"